      "name": "Play",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-play",
      "description": "Primary playback action, enabled after text is loaded.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-play\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 5 11 7-11 7V5Z\"/></svg><span>Play</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-play{font-family:Atkinson,system-ui,sans-serif;transition:background-color .15s ease,color .15s ease;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-width:123px;height:53px;padding:0 20px;color:var(--surface,#fff);background:var(--blue,#2455da);border:0;border-radius:28px;font-weight:700;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5;cursor:pointer}.ds-play svg{width:23px;height:23px;fill:currentColor}.ds-play:hover:enabled{background:var(--play-hover,#1944b5)}.ds-play:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--blue,#2455da);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-play:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:default}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-play{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Pick a starting point",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-pick",
      "description": "Outlined page-selection action; pale fill also signals picking.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-pick\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 3 14 9-7 1-3 7-4-17Z\"/></svg>Pick a starting point</button>",
      "css": ".ds-pick{font-family:Atkinson,system-ui,sans-serif;transition:background-color .15s ease,color .15s ease;width:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;border:1px solid var(--pick-border,#a9bce9);border-radius:9px;background:var(--surface,#fff);padding:12px;color:var(--blue,#2455da);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.5;cursor:pointer}.ds-pick svg{width:22px;height:22px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.7;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.ds-pick:hover,.ds-pick.ds-picking{background:var(--selection,#e6edff)}.ds-pick:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--blue,#2455da);outline-offset:3px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-pick{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Icon action",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-icon",
      "description": "Quiet square control for settings and passage skipping.",
