      "description": "Full-width native selection field with a visible external focus ring.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field-label\" for=\"ds-voice\">Voice</label><select class=\"ds-field\" id=\"ds-voice\"><option>Kore</option><option>Puck</option></select>",
      "css": ".ds-field-label{font-family:Atkinson,system-ui,sans-serif;display:block;color:var(--ink,#182846);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin:15px 0 6px;line-height:1.5}.ds-field{font-family:Atkinson,system-ui,sans-serif;transition:background-color .15s ease,color .15s ease;width:100%;border:1px solid var(--field-border,#b9c5d9);background:var(--surface,#fff);color:var(--ink,#182846);border-radius:7px;padding:10px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;min-width:0;cursor:pointer}.ds-field:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--blue,#2455da);outline-offset:3px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-field{transition:none}}"
